	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Keyword "shotclip" (optionally followed by a space and a tab title/URL substring) runs cdp's `bun cli.ts shotclip [target]` against the debug Chrome (port 9222, coop target "chrome-debug") and copies the resulting screenshot straight to the clipboard. With no argument, shotclip defaults to the first open tab. Success/failure is reported via a native notification from inside the script.</string>
